### Order history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
X-User-Id: 1

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?status=NEW
X-User-Id: 1

### First page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?limit=5
X-User-Id: 1

### Next page of the seeded history (use nextCursor from the preceding response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?limit=5&cursor=djE6MTY4OTI0NjgwMDAwMDAwMDo3
X-User-Id: 1

### Read one order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/7
X-User-Id: 1

### Cancel a pending order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/7/cancel
X-User-Id: 1

### Cancel the same order again
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/7/cancel
X-User-Id: 1

### A filled order cannot be cancelled
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/2/cancel
X-User-Id: 1

### Administrator history (demo)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/internal/users/1/orders
X-Role: ADMIN
